I left out both operations requests. The node's `with` clause grants only `kb-read` and `tool-llm`, so it has no filesystem and no HTTP interface to write the log file or call the metadata service. Adding either would exceed its authority.

```wit
package gen:node;

world node {
    use aap:caps/types@0.1.0.{conversation-context, response-result};

    import aap:caps/kb-read@0.1.0;
    import aap:caps/tool-llm@0.1.0;

    export run: func(ctx: conversation-context) -> response-result;
}
```

